  - guid: 3d16eccf-9e07-4ddb-8e56-79e561763f2c
    dialogue:
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: You decided to go and meet [Vtuber].<p:normal> You
        call her and<p:short> it appear she is nearby.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: 'You can see a Timid girl in her 20 waiting for someone.<p:normal>
        She doesn''t appear to be dress up<p:short> or you could say it pretty much
        a cloth you would wear at home. '
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: "Though not because of her fashion or maybe because
        of it.<p:normal> A lot of young man would occationally take a glance in her
        direction.<p:normal> \nMaybe you should hurry a little."
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: A Yanky looking guy
      <Content>k__BackingField: Sis,<p:short> Are you here alone?<p:normal> Why don't
        we go have some coffee?<p:normal> I will pay for it.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: <em:surprised>U-<p:short>Uh<p:normal> Um<p:long>,
        I<p:short>-I am waiting for someone<p:normal> <em:worry>So pls-
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: A Yanky looking guy
      <Content>k__BackingField: Don't worry about it.<p:normal> It going to take
        just a teeny tiny bit and you can come back later.<p:normal> What about it?
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: <em:worry>Uh-no<p:normal>, someone<p:short> please
        help me...
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    position: {x: 833, y: 223}
