  - guid: c0baa087-aa66-4af1-9687-a3987efdb1ae
    dialogue:
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: You decided to do<p:short> nothing<p:normal> and
        watch as she stumble her way thought the conversation.<p:normal> As helping
        her would have hinder her growth as a person.<add:VtuberAffection:-10><add:VtuberSuspicion:15>
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: After sometime has pass the man finally walk away
        leaving her in a state of complete exhaustion.<p:normal> After a moment she
        finally drag her exhausted body in you direction.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: 'So,<p:short> How was the conversation? '
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: '<em:angry>You<p:normal> YOU<p:long> TRAITOR!!! '
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: She walk away angrily.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 1
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: But because it is not very fast you decide to slowly
        walk after her.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
