  - guid: fda5bb10-c9de-44ec-a785-529fb38a3416
    dialogue:
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: LOOK<p:short>, IS THAT A UFO?!
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: A Yanky looking guy
      <Content>k__BackingField: Huh?<p:normal> Where?<p:normal>
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: As people started to look at the sky.<p:normal> You
        grab her hand and run away.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: (Sighing heavily)<p:normal> I think We lost them.<p:normal>
        Are you ok?<add:VtuberAffection:3><add:VtuberSuspicion:1>
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: '<em:worry>I am<p:short> ugh<p:normal>-<p:tiny> fine.<p:normal>
        But<p:short> can we rest for a bit? '
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: Sure.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: You and the girl decided to rest for a bit before
        continuing.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
