  - guid: 7c26dfd3-c700-42fd-8fa5-406ae0955740
    dialogue:
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: Oh,<p:normal> so he wasn't hiting on you?
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: <em:surprised>Oh-no<p:normal>, he was handing me
        this pamphlet.<p:normal><em:worry> And I don't really need it<p:short> <em:default>but
        I don't know how to reject him.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: So<p:short> Um<p:normal>, Sorry for interrupting?
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: "\"<em:surprised>No need<p:normal>, <em:happy>I glad
        you come to <em:embarrass>uh-<p:short> help me.<p:normal> <em:default>So<p:normal>,
        \nWhy did you called me out?\""
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: Oh<p:normal>,I just want to hang out do you have
        anywhere you want to go.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: Vtuber
      <Content>k__BackingField: <em:worry>Not realllly~<p:normal> <em:surprised>Oh<p:short>
        I do have some new manga I want to check.<p:normal> <em:default>Can you come
        with me to the book store?
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: You
      <Content>k__BackingField: Sure<p:normal>, I can also check out some book while
        I am there too.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - <CharacterName>k__BackingField: 
      <Content>k__BackingField: You and the girl decided to go to the book store
        to check out some new book.
      <HideCharacter>k__BackingField: 0
      <DialogueEvent>k__BackingField:
